OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSALucy Letby hospital could have
OL,4,Aprevented some baby deaths, inquiry
OL,5,Afinds
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe behaviour of hospital executives
OL,8,Fwas "high-handed" and "foolhardy". Tony
OL,9,FChambers - who resigned as the trust's
OL,10,Fchief in 2018 - had a "dictatorial"
OL,11,Fmanner, the report says
OL,13,FAmong Thirlwall's recommendations are
OL,14,FCCTV for all cots and incubators in
OL,15,Fneonatal units, plus restricting access
OL,16,Fto insulin and creating a panel of
OL,17,Fexperts for when concerns are raised
OL,18,Fabout harm to patients
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
